<title>SPAIN: Iberdrola group Q1 profit falls 5.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Iberdrola group Q1 profit falls 5.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Group results for three months to</p>
<p>March in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Net profit			     32.20     down   5.3 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name Iberdrola SA.</p>
<p>The firm said results were considered &quot;satisfactory&quot; given operating conditions, negatively affected by a three percent fall in the tariff and lower demand for electricity after a mild winter.</p>
<p>Operating revenues fell 3.1 percent.</p>
</text>
